{"id":92,"name":"gastly","speciesId":92,"dex":92,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["ghost","poison"],"stats":{"hp":30,"attack":35,"defense":30,"special-attack":100,"special-defense":35,"speed":80},"abilities":[{"name":"levitate","hidden":false}],"height":13,"weight":1,"baseExp":62,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/92.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/92.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/92.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/92.ogg","genus":"Gas Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"Almost invisible, this gaseous POKéMON cloaks the target and puts it to sleep without notice."},{"version":"yellow","text":"Said to appear in decrepit, deserted buildings. It has no real shape as it appears to be made of a gas."},{"version":"gold","text":"With its gas-like body, it can sneak into any place it desires. However, it can be blown away by wind."},{"version":"silver","text":"Its thin body is made of gas. It can envelop an opponent of any size and cause suffocation."},{"version":"crystal","text":"It wraps its op­ ponent in its gas- like body, slowly weakening its prey by poisoning it through the skin."},{"version":"ruby","text":"GASTLY is largely composed of gaseous matter. When exposed to a strong wind, the gaseous body quickly dwindles away. Groups of this POKéMON cluster under the eaves of houses to escape the ravages of wind."},{"version":"emerald","text":"When exposed to a strong wind, a GASTLY’s gaseous body quickly dwindles away. They cluster under the eaves of houses to escape the ravages of wind."},{"version":"firered","text":"A being that exists as a thin gas. It can topple an Indian elephant by enveloping the prey in two seconds."},{"version":"diamond","text":"This Pokémon’s body is 95% made 